## V0001 -- `lume prove` found inputs for which the ensures clause is false (the counterexample is in the message).
## command: lume prove   (this file shows the diagnostic: the gate runs a copy named .src; V0001_contract_refuted.fixed.src is the corrected program)
## fix: fix the clause or the body; the counterexample shows the failing inputs
fn dec(x: int) -> int
    ensures result > x
    = x - 1
